{"id":"3b5f38bd115ed203","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-lattice.md","title":"Lattice","display":"df-lattice — Lattice","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-lattice","aliases":["93-df-lattice"],"display":"df-lattice — Lattice","depends_on":["[[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-lattice"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-lattice</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-lattice — Lattice"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e30eac382dc7d1a7\" href=\"?note=e30eac382dc7d1a7\" title=\"93-df-set-theoretic-background\">93-df-set-theoretic-background</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf L\">\\(\\mathbf L\\)</span> is a lattice candidate; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathbf L|\">\\(|\\mathbf L|\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\wedge^{\\mathbf L}\">\\(\\wedge^{\\mathbf L}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vee^{\\mathbf L}\">\\(\\vee^{\\mathbf L}\\)</span> denote its displayed carrier and operations.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lat}\">\\(\\mathrm{Lat}\\)</span> is the lattice class and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LatHom}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{LatHom}_{93}\\)</span> is the lattice-homomorphism predicate defined here.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_{\\mathbf L}\">\\(\\leq_{\\mathbf L}\\)</span> is the induced lattice order defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lattice}\\vdash\\mathbf L\\in\\mathrm{Lat}\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists L\\;\\exists m\\;\\exists j\\;\\Bigl[{}&amp;\\mathbf L=\\langle L,m,j\\rangle\\land L\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land m,j:L^2\\to L\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in L\\;\\bigl[m(a,b)=m(b,a)\\land j(a,b)=j(b,a)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land m(m(a,b),c)=m(a,m(b,c))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land j(j(a,b),c)=j(a,j(b,c))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land m(a,j(a,b))=a\\land j(a,m(a,b))=a\\bigr]\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lattice}\\vdash\\mathbf L\\in\\mathrm{Lat}\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists L\\;\\exists m\\;\\exists j\\;\\Bigl[{}&amp;\\mathbf L=\\langle L,m,j\\rangle\\land L\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land m,j:L^2\\to L\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in L\\;\\bigl[m(a,b)=m(b,a)\\land j(a,b)=j(b,a)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land m(m(a,b),c)=m(a,m(b,c))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land j(j(a,b),c)=j(a,j(b,c))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land m(a,j(a,b))=a\\land j(a,m(a,b))=a\\bigr]\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lattice}\\vdash\na\\leq_{\\mathbf L}b\\leftrightarrow\na,b\\in|\\mathbf L|\\land a\\wedge^{\\mathbf L}b=a\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lattice}\\vdash\na\\leq_{\\mathbf L}b\\leftrightarrow\na,b\\in|\\mathbf L|\\land a\\wedge^{\\mathbf L}b=a\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lattice}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LatHom}_{93}(h,\\mathbf L,\\mathbf K)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathbf L,\\mathbf K\\in\\mathrm{Lat}\\land h:|\\mathbf L|\\to|\\mathbf K|\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b\\in|\\mathbf L|\\;\\bigl(\nh(a\\wedge^{\\mathbf L}b)=h(a)\\wedge^{\\mathbf K}h(b)\n\\land h(a\\vee^{\\mathbf L}b)=h(a)\\vee^{\\mathbf K}h(b)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lattice}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LatHom}_{93}(h,\\mathbf L,\\mathbf K)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathbf L,\\mathbf K\\in\\mathrm{Lat}\\land h:|\\mathbf L|\\to|\\mathbf K|\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b\\in|\\mathbf L|\\;\\bigl(\nh(a\\wedge^{\\mathbf L}b)=h(a)\\wedge^{\\mathbf K}h(b)\n\\land h(a\\vee^{\\mathbf L}b)=h(a)\\vee^{\\mathbf K}h(b)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>All tuple components are bound inside the class predicate, so membership in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lat}\">\\(\\mathrm{Lat}\\)</span> has no contextual carrier or operation parameters. The homomorphism predicate is tailored to this flat lattice encoding instead of relying on the generic universal-algebra encoding.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-set-theoretic-background","status":"resolved","id":"e30eac382dc7d1a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf L","display":false},{"tex":"|\\mathbf L|","display":false},{"tex":"\\wedge^{\\mathbf L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vee^{\\mathbf L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Lat}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LatHom}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_{\\mathbf L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lattice}\\vdash\\mathbf L\\in\\mathrm{Lat}\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists L\\;\\exists m\\;\\exists j\\;\\Bigl[{}&\\mathbf L=\\langle L,m,j\\rangle\\land L\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land m,j:L^2\\to L\\\\\n&\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in L\\;\\bigl[m(a,b)=m(b,a)\\land j(a,b)=j(b,a)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land m(m(a,b),c)=m(a,m(b,c))\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land j(j(a,b),c)=j(a,j(b,c))\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land m(a,j(a,b))=a\\land j(a,m(a,b))=a\\bigr]\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lattice}\\vdash\na\\leq_{\\mathbf L}b\\leftrightarrow\na,b\\in|\\mathbf L|\\land a\\wedge^{\\mathbf L}b=a","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lattice}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LatHom}_{93}(h,\\mathbf L,\\mathbf K)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathbf L,\\mathbf K\\in\\mathrm{Lat}\\land h:|\\mathbf L|\\to|\\mathbf K|\\\\\n&\\land\\forall a,b\\in|\\mathbf L|\\;\\bigl(\nh(a\\wedge^{\\mathbf L}b)=h(a)\\wedge^{\\mathbf K}h(b)\n\\land h(a\\vee^{\\mathbf L}b)=h(a)\\vee^{\\mathbf K}h(b)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Lat}","display":false}],"bytes":1778,"backlinks":[{"id":"f6dfa3af0b7ff312","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"74c997e395e53951","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf L$ is a lattice candidate and $\\leq_{\\mathbf L}$ is the induced order of [[93-df-lattice]]."},{"id":"135c0cfcbae1f3c5","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Lat}$ is the lattice class of [[93-df-lattice]]."},{"id":"ba4d7ca4d35e9c4d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf L$ is a lattice candidate; $\\mathrm{Lat}$ is the lattice class of [[93-df-lattice]], and $\\mathrm{DistLat}$ is defined here."},{"id":"9beeac4373d773f8","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf A$ is a lattice candidate and $\\leq_{\\mathbf A}$ is the induced order of [[93-df-lattice]]."},{"id":"edc4ffdba40ef7c6","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"247282d0ac964dd5","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf A$ is a lattice candidate and $\\leq_{\\mathbf A}$ is the induced order of [[93-df-lattice]]."},{"id":"3a47eea6cc9e560d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Lat}$ is the lattice class of [[93-df-lattice]]."},{"id":"0c4f99f2719ded5b","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf L$ is a lattice candidate and $\\leq_{\\mathbf L}$ is the induced order of [[93-df-lattice]]."},{"id":"0ce60c713fd9ffed","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"69fd12190649a7f7","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b963bc19cca0cdb2","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0eb6f89ad348c35f","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"38bccd77c29488bb","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f983e6b98c86a8fa","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Lat}$ is the lattice class of [[93-df-lattice]]."},{"id":"b20ef7537d531bd9","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf A$ is a lattice candidate and $\\varnothing\\neq X\\subseteq|\\mathbf A|$; $\\mathrm{Lat}$ is the lattice class of [[93-df-lattice]]."},{"id":"5459c1273ed2da77","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"bcf5fa8a7fd2252e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Lat}$ is the lattice class of [[93-df-lattice]]."},{"id":"7640f770f9f763e9","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Lat}$ is the lattice class of [[93-df-lattice]]."},{"id":"e724ed0eebd9a8cf","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Lat}$ and $\\mathrm{DistLat}$ are the classes defined in [[93-df-lattice]] and [[93-df-distributive]]."},{"id":"57abb955e28f83aa","anchor":"ref-53","l